# NO-TRACKING environment for the bashy kopia verified build.
# Shell-sourceable; shipped as a release asset so a launcher applies exactly
# what this build was gated against. Every knob is documented in
# builds/kopia/README.md with its upstream source at the pinned tag.
#
# Usage: set -a; . bashy-build/no-tracking.env; set +a
#
# Kopia's one documented outbound call is its periodic GitHub release check,
# and KOPIA_CHECK_FOR_UPDATES below is the switch that turns it off — set here
# rather than passed as a flag, because the flag is not a global one. At this
# tag `--[no-]check-for-updates` is declared by the repository connect options
# (cli/command_repository_connect.go), so it parses after a subcommand that
# installs them and is an "unknown long flag" anywhere else, so negating it
# before a subcommand fails the invocation outright. The envar is the same
# switch read from one place — cli/update_check.go consults
# KOPIA_CHECK_FOR_UPDATES directly in maybeCheckForUpdates(), and it is also
# the flag's own Envar — so it holds for every invocation and every argv order.
#
# MUST also pass globally on both `repository create` and `server start`:
#   --no-persist-credentials  keep headless runs out of OS credential stores;
#                             macOS otherwise uses Keychain by default
#   --otlp-trace              kopia's supported OTLP exporter, a global flag
#                             that goes BEFORE the subcommand; otel.env pins
#                             its destination at 127.0.0.1:31415
#                             (upstream flag reference:
#                              https://kopia.io/docs/reference/command-line/flags/)
# files/no-egress-test.sh is what proves the policy held for THIS build.
KOPIA_CHECK_FOR_UPDATES=false
#
# Go's net/http honours the proxy environment, so an operator shell that
# exports a proxy would hand the service an egress path it never asked for.
# Clearing all three and allowing only loopback in NO_PROXY closes that door.
HTTP_PROXY=
HTTPS_PROXY=
http_proxy=
https_proxy=
ALL_PROXY=
all_proxy=
NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
no_proxy=127.0.0.1,::1,localhost
